/-!
# A359051

Irregular table T(n, k), n > 0, k = 1..A000010(n); the n-th row lists the numbers k such that fusc(k) + fusc(k+1) = n, where "fusc" is Stern's diatomic series (A002487).

The 64 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A359051

/-- Known terms of `flat`, starting at index `1`. -/
def flatData : List flatRetType :=
  [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 7, 5, 6, 8, 15,
    16, 31, 9, 11, 12, 14, 32, 63, 10, 13,
    64, 127, 17, 23, 24, 30, 128, 255, 19, 28,
    256, 511, 18, 20, 27, 29, 33, 47, 48, 62,
    512, 1023, 22, 25, 1024, 2047, 21, 26, 35, 39,
